     "info_id": "info-3afcded907f742d9bad009887df04b34",
     "kind": "user_stated_constraint",
     "detected_text": "先说一个前提：线上跑任务的 runner 还是 Debian 11 自带的解释器，短期内不会升级，所以重构后的代码必须保持对 Python 3.10 的兼容，别用 3.11+ 才有的语法。",
     "span_in_B": {
      "turn_id": "synth-c3-t000",
      "char_start": 168,
      "char_end": 262
     },
     "status_in_A": "unknown",
     "reframed_text_in_A": null,
     "confidence": "reliable"
    },
    {
     "info_id": "info-0152e4ea94dd450f959b07c67eabbaa0",
     "kind": "user_stated_constraint",
     "detected_text": "对，legacy/ 那几个文件是老 BI 系统还在调的，跟这次重构无关，你重构过程中不要修改 legacy/ 目录下的任何文件，哪怕只是格式化也不行，那边没有测试，改坏了没人兜底。",
     "span_in_B": {
      "turn_id": "synth-c3-t004",
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 90
     },
     "status_in_A": "unknown",
     "reframed_text_in_A": null,
